FORM mini subclass SILKSCREEN_TOP
setwindow FORM.mini
FORM mini line_width 0.2
FORM mini lock_direction Off
setwindow pcb
pick -10.86 -5.6
pick -10.86 -5.6
done
Add Line
setwindow FORM.mini
FORM mini class PACKAGE GEOMETRY
FORM mini subclass SILKSCREEN_TOP
setwindow FORM.mini
FORM mini line_width 0.2
